<title>JAPAN: Kimoto - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kimoto - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 14.80		vs	   13.85</p>
<p> Operating	  366    million	  vs	  415    million</p>
<p> Current	    350    million	  vs	  398    million</p>
<p> Net		  144    million	  vs	  164    million</p>
<p> EPS		   10.63 yen	  vs	   12.26 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     14 million	  vs	  13 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  9.00 yen	  vs	    8.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kimoto Co Ltd is maker of speciality films for drafting, surveying and plate making.</p>
